msgid "Home Assistant is the open-source home-automation platform. It ships a **native Model Context Protocol Server integration** ([`mcp_server`](https://www.home-assistant.io/integrations/mcp_server/)) that implements Streamable HTTP and exposes Home Assistant's Assist API to MCP clients, with per-entity access control (only explicitly exposed entities are reachable). It can control lights, climate, covers, switches, sensors, media players, fans, locks, vacuums, and cameras."
