# libretranslate
msgid "Mechanism: a Postfix transport for `.onion` next-hops via a SOCKS-aware delivery path (e.g. a `torsocks`-wrapped transport or a SOCKS relay), gated on `svc-net-tor` being active. Public-Internet mail to non-onion domains stays on the normal path."
