msgid "The push entry synchronizes the current repository's `main` branch from the configured source repository before CI policy and deploy discovery run. The default source is `infinito-nexus/core`, and `CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY` MAY override or disable the sync as documented in [configuration.md](../../tools/github/actions/configuration.md). This sync **force-overwrites** the local `main`, so on a synced repository you MUST NOT work directly in `main`; use a `feature/**`, `fix/**`, or `hotfix/**` branch and treat `main` as a read-only mirror."
msgstr ""

