msgid "The role is a critical component in a secure backup scheme. By isolating backup operations to a dedicated user, it minimizes the risk of unauthorized actions. The role configures the SSH environment so that only specific, allowed commands can be executed, and it sets up passwordless sudo rights for rsync, ensuring smooth and secure backup operations."
