msgid "Unblock the `biber` persona. Listmonk matches OIDC users by e-mail and the role provisions no biber account; `cmd/auth.go` `OIDCFinish` 404s unless `security.oidc.auto_create_users` is true, and `createOIDCUser` passes `UserRoleID` as a plain int, so `default_user_role_id` must name a real role. The seeded database holds exactly one (`id=1 Super Admin`), so unblocking biber means first creating a limited Listmonk user role. It buys no coverage the administrator persona does not already buy."
