msgid "`web-app-keycloak` MUST NOT expose its administration API as a general MCP tool server. It MAY provide OAuth authorization infrastructure for MCP servers by provisioning an explicit resource/audience, client policy, scope, and redirect contract per provider. Experimental token exchange MUST remain disabled for MCP until the exact Keycloak, client, and server versions pass user-delegation and revocation tests."
